  # Check Multi Ues Setting In List                                 multiUesList=${listOfUes}
    CallSetup.Setup Wtsemu SA                                       nbUe=${totalNbOfUe}
    ...                                                             nbSaUe=${totalNbOfUe}
    ...                                                             shouldUseLua=False
    ...                                                             shouldSaveBasicCfg=True
    WTS Set X2 Link
    sleep    5s



Set Rank for UEs

