    Dated Log New Line    ================ Iteration ${it}/${num_iteration} ================
    Dated Log New Line    ========== Step 1 > Modify and Check Rim Rs ==========

    SA DeRegister Multi UEs                  listOfUes=${listOfUes}

    Dated Log New Line     Modify Rim Rs on Cell2 and Cell3
    coam_parameter.perform_scf_delta_commission    delta_file=${Cell2_Cell3_numRbForRs_96}
